    <briefdescription>
<para>A thread pool for executing tasks concurrently. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classscc_1_1sc__thread__pool" kindref="compound">sc_thread_pool</ref> class provides a mechanism for executing SystemC tasks concurrently using a pool of worker SC_THREADs. It allows users to specify the maximum number of concurrent threads and provides a simple interface for submitting tasks to be executed.</para>
